{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 iPad mini (A17 Pro) Wi-Fi 帶來新一輪優惠，128GB 型號減幅 17%，入手價 US$499。其他容量方面，256GB 減幅 14% 至 US$599，512GB 減幅 11% 至 US$799。三款容量均以低於原價的售價發售，適合想入手輕巧平板的用家。現時價位吸引，正是把握優惠的好時機。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"ipadmini 1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"536\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ipadmini-1-1024x536.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2>iPad mini (A17 Pro) Wi-Fi 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>強勁 A17 Pro 晶片與 AI 效能</strong>：配備 6 核 CPU、5 核 GPU 及 16 核 Neural Engine，支援 Apple Intelligence，日常多工、剪片與 AI 功能操作更流暢。</li>\n<li><strong>8.3 吋全螢幕顯示</strong>：8.3 吋 Liquid Retina 全螢幕具備 2266 x 1488 解像度、326 ppi、P3 寬色域及 500 nits 亮度，配合抗反射塗層，觀看影片或戶外使用都清晰。</li>\n<li><strong>輕巧機身支援 Apple Pencil Pro</strong>：機身僅 19.54 x 13.48 x 0.63cm、重 293g，單手可用，並支援 Apple Pencil Pro 的懸浮感應、擠壓與滾筒轉向，方便筆記繪圖。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DK3W6TV6?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple iPad mini (A17 Pro): Apple Intelligence, 8.3-inch Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, Wi-Fi 6E, 12MP Front/12MP Back Camera, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Space Gray\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41s4Llo6qYL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DK3W6TV6?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple iPad mini (A17 Pro): Apple Intelligence, 8.3-inch Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, Wi-Fi 6E, 12MP Front/12MP Back Camera, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Space Gray</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$499.00</p>\n<p>$599.00</p>\n<p>-17%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DK3W6TV6?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DK3XM94S?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple iPad mini (A17 Pro): Apple Intelligence, 8.3-inch Liquid Retina Display, 256GB, Wi-Fi 6E, 12MP Front/12MP Back Camera, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Space Gray\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41s4Llo6qYL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DK3XM94S?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple iPad mini (A17 Pro): Apple Intelligence, 8.3-inch Liquid Retina Display, 256GB, Wi-Fi 6E, 12MP Front/12MP Back Camera, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Space Gray</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$599.00</p>\n<p>$699.00</p>\n<p>-14%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DK3XM94S?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DK3XT3DX?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple iPad mini (A17 Pro): Apple Intelligence, 8.3-inch Liquid Retina Display, 512GB, Wi-Fi 6E, 12MP Front/12MP Back Camera, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Space Gray\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41s4Llo6qYL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DK3XT3DX?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple iPad mini (A17 Pro): Apple Intelligence, 8.3-inch Liquid Retina Display, 512GB, Wi-Fi 6E, 12MP Front/12MP Back Camera, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Space Gray</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$799.00</p>\n<p>$899.00</p>\n<p>-11%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DK3XT3DX?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>為什麼會顯示沒有貨？</h2>\n<p>如果大家的 Amazon 帳號設定了本地地址，這樣當顯示美國限定產品時是會顯示「沒有供應」，然而大家只要輸入一些<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/2019/05/06/buy-and-ship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">集運公司的地址</a>，這樣就可以正常顯示價格及送貨。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Amazon 美國送貨地址設定\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"868\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/amazon-us-address.jpg\" width=\"1630\"/></figure>\n<h2>購買美版的 AppleCare 保修問題</h2>\n<p>不少人也對海外購買 Apple 產品的保修有疑問，其實 Apple 產品很多時也是全球性維修，不過 AppleCare+ 的意外換機則必須要原來的購買地才可。那就是你不能買美國版 AppleCare+ 在香港／台灣要求意外更換，必須要在美國更換。不過，維修一般沒有問題，當然每個地區的 Apple Store 也有其不同的。</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T18:06:02.647177+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1403,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T17:39:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T05:47:27.239972+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T17:59:02.124518+00:00","content_hash":"8f88e51a050cea956fdc308b97bed83a379625dae7cc01c791107219905f1092","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}